// Growth that keeps everything it makes, shaped by a few rocks.
name Coral
rule B1/S12345678
steps 4
hint Here nothing dies: every cell that is born stays. The rocks carved the shape.
tip Nothing dies here, so the origin is still alive: it is the very heart of the coral.
intro Here nothing dies. Everything ever born is still here, packed against the rocks that shaped it.
outro The origin is still alive at the heart of it. Some things keep their beginning.
